  "goodToKnow": "Die Zivilgesellschaft is civil society: associations, NGOs, foundations, churches and citizens' initiatives outside state and market. In Germany, around 29 million people volunteer (Ehrenamt), from fire brigades to refugee help. In early 2024, mass demonstrations against right-wing extremism were described as a show of strength by the Zivilgesellschaft. Zivil means civilian: in Zivil (in plain clothes). Plural: die Zivilgesellschaften."
